issue.body:
Add Huhim's tank. Features:
- Press C to charge, dealing double damage;
- Press X to fire 8 bullets in 8 directions;
- Press V to escape (teleport to the mirror position in the arena) and leave a bomb at the original position!

In addition, we add an explosion effect for the bullet upon hitting the target.

